  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Rotgut.png\" title=\"Rotgut the Bloated\"><img alt=\"Rotgut the Bloated\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/recovered/Rotgut.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Rotgut.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Rotgut the Bloated</div></div></div>\n<p>Rotgut the Bloated (The Mutantous Malaise) Level 30-50\n</p><p>Skill:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Knockdown Charge\n</li><li>Holler Roller\n</li><li>Butcher \n</li></ul>\n<p>Resistances:<br/>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Good Poison Resist<br/>\n</li><li>Low Fire Resist<br/>\n</li><li>Good Ice Resist<br/>\n</li><li>Good Shadow Resist<br/>\n</li><li>Good Divine Resist<br/>\n</li></ul>\n<p>Although Rotgut looks pretty horrendous, he actually does not do much but sit there, blasting away with his machine gun, and occasionally rolling forward for a Knockdown.  It is fairly easy to deal with Rotgut first and then go after his support troops.\n</p><p>One <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Builds\" title=\"Category:Builds\">Build</a> which has proven effective against Rotgut is <a href=\"/wiki/Pyromancer_Toasting_Rotgut\" title=\"Pyromancer Toasting Rotgut\">Pyromancer Toasting Rotgut</a>.\n</p><p>For tips on fighting Rotgut, check out the <a href=\"/wiki/Boss_Guide\" title=\"Boss Guide\">Rotgut Boss Guide</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Support\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Support</span></h2>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<a name=\"Rotgut.27s_Groupie\"></a><h5> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Rotgut's Groupie</span></h5>\n<p><b>Class: </b>Ranger Champion<br/>These gals can be tough.  Like most Ranger types, they like to move away from you and use their ranged weapons.  They are found in large groups in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">Room of Creation</a>, accompanied by Rotgut's Roadies.\n</p>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rotgut's_Groupie.jpg\" title=\"Rotgut's Groupie\"><img alt=\"Rotgut's Groupie\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"320\" src=\"/images/Rotgut's_Groupie.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Rotgut's_Groupie.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Rotgut's Groupie</div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<a name=\"Rotgut.27s_Roadie\"></a><h5> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Rotgut's Roadie</span></h5>\n<p><b>Class: </b>Melee Champion<br/>\n</p><p>These guys are found in large groups and will crowd in on you for close combat.  This gives Rotgut's Groupies a chance to stand back and get maximum damage from their ranged weapons.\n</p>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Rotgut's_Roadie.jpg\" title=\"Rotgut's Roadie\"><img alt=\"Rotgut's Roadie\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"174\" src=\"/images/Rotgut's_Roadie.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Rotgut's_Roadie.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Rotgut's Roadie</div></div></div>\n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
